{"id":"1bd72595481bc91b","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md","title":"保守扩张在旧语言中不创造定理","display":"thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity — 保守扩张在旧语言中不创造定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity","aliases":["91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity","91-thm-non-creativity","91-thm-conservative-character"],"display":"thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity — 保守扩张在旧语言中不创造定理","depends_on":["[[91-df-conservative-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity</span><span>91-thm-non-creativity</span><span>91-thm-conservative-character</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity — 保守扩张在旧语言中不创造定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal S\\)</span> (基础理论及其真理语言扩张)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (旧语言句子集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal B)\\)</span> (旧语言保守性)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}non\\text{-}creativity}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal S\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal B)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal B\\vdash\\varphi\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}non\\text{-}creativity}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal S\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal B)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal B\\vdash\\varphi\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>从左到右正是保守性的定义；从右到左来自理论包含\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal S\\)</span>。因此“非创造性”不是额外证明论奇迹，\n而是保守扩张在旧语言上的同义重述。</p>\n<p>标准 TB、UTB 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> 满足这一性质；带全\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span>-归纳的完整 CT 和标准 KF 则不能仅按“类型化/无类型”\n标签分类。旧语言无新增也不代表扩展语言中没有大量新的真理断言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}non\\text{-}creativity}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal S\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal B)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal B\\vdash\\varphi\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false}],"bytes":1498,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-157","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-158","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md]]\n[[91-thm-typed-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative.md]]"}],"outgoing":["4a1d989a5f615933"]}